WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.120
How much is this bracelet?

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.780
The bracelet is a thousand.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.780
Can I get a discount?

4
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.660
Well, it depends on how many pieces you plan to take.

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.360
Well, one.

6
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.260
Then there is no discount.

7
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.460
Why?

8
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.460
Because the price of one bracelet is a thousand.

9
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.720
Fine, it can be 700.

10
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.700
Really, it is not my merchandise. I am just a worker here.

11
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:24.780
I can't.

12
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.860
750 and that's it.

13
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.900
I am sorry, I really can't.

14
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.880
Come on, 800, not a dinar more, that is what I said.

15
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.440
1300, please.

16
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:39.940
Well, how come now?

17
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.660
Just like that, 1300.

18
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.780
But you said it is not your merchandise, you are just a worker.

19
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.960
Okay, I understood.

20
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.020
The real price of the bracelet is 1000.

21
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.860
1000 for the bracelet and that's it, I understand.
